Volume keys now work even where the firmware eats them

• New in Settings: catch volume keys via the audio route — for devices (like Viwoods) that swallow them before apps can see them. Single, double and long press all work. Leave single press unassigned and it keeps changing the volume, so one press is volume, a double press is your action.
• Capture now filters phantom twin events (Bigme B7 Pro page keys), shows raw key codes, and tells you to hold the key if a tap isn't reported.
